string.text:
An envoy presents a vassal oath sealed with the royal mark:

[VASSALAGE TREATY]
Suzerain: {SUZERAIN}
Subject: {VASSAL}
Treaty type: {TYPE}
Signed: {DATE}

[BASIC TERMS]
1. The {TYPE} recognizes {SUZERAIN} as suzerain and continues under this treaty identity.
2. The {TYPE} keeps its crown, court, clans, and internal governance; this treaty is not annexation.
{CLAUSES}

The tributary caravan has reached the court. The ledger records:

Subject: {TRIBUTARY}
Recorded: {DATE}
Tribute value: {VALUE}

[SUZERAIN FIEF GAINS]
{GAINS}
[TRIBUTARY COST]
{COST}

Venue: {SETTLEMENT}
Selected guests: {COUNT}.
Choose a clan to open its member list.

Clan: {CLAN}
This is a player-hosted gathering; governors may still be invited. Heroes with independent parties are dispatched directly. Nobles remaining in towns, governors, and heroes without parties travel to the venue using the native system, then return to their original settlement after the gathering.
Selected guests: {COUNT}.

Venue: {SETTLEMENT}
Cost: {COST} denars
Duration: {DAYS} days
Guests: {GUESTS}

Confirming will deduct the cost and send gathering invitations to the guests.
